        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of all three major criteria: neonatal erythroderma, autoinflammatory features, and inflammatory bowel disease",
    "notes": "Genetic testing and exclusion of other neonatal erythroderma syndromes are important for confirmation."
